Assay invokes third-party scanners as separate container images built under
scanners/. Those images carry their own licences, including copyleft ones
(ClamAV is GPL-2.0, TruffleHog is AGPL-3.0). They are executed as separate
processes over a documented two-argument contract and no part of their source
is linked into Assay, so their terms apply to those images rather than to this
work. Source for the unmodified upstream tools is available from their
respective projects.
